  "notes": "{禁止|きんし} is used for official prohibitions and bans.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {禁止|きんし}する (to prohibit, to ban)\n- {禁止|きんし}されている (is prohibited)\n- 〜{禁止|きんし} (~ prohibited - on signs)\n\nCOMMON SIGNS:\n- {駐車|ちゅうしゃ}{禁止|きんし} (No Parking)\n- {立入|たちいり}{禁止|きんし} (No Entry)\n- {撮影|さつえい}{禁止|きんし} (No Photography)\n- {喫煙|きつえん}{禁止|きんし} (No Smoking)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {禁止|きんし}: prohibition (official)\n- {禁|きん}じる: to forbid (literary verb)\n- だめ: no good, not allowed (casual)",
